027cqw;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Consolidación de Paisaje Trinacional</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Zona Núcleo (R2): </span><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">14,500 ha - Bosque Nuboso</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Amortiguamiento (R3): </span><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">22,000 ha - Café, Maíz, Frijol (Producción Sostenible).</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Productores Activos: </span><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">3,250</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Estado: </span><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Buffer Consolidado</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Prioridad de Conservación: </span><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Alta</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Convenios Activos: </span><span style=\"font-size:1.11027cqw;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">18</span></p></div><div class=\"element text\" style=\"left:7.26722%;top:80.46293%;width:86.47994%;height:14.97288%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0.00000cqw 0.00000cqw 0.00000cqw 0.00000cqw;--delay:1.03s\"><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:2.22054cqw;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">Conexión directa del R2 (Área Protegida Volcán Suchitán) con el R3 (Productores locales).</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:2.22054cqw;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">El ecosistema identifica visualmente las brechas territoriales para focalizar el próximo convenio financiero.</span></p></div>", "original": 12, "kind": "original", "id": "original-12"}, {"html": "", "background": "#f4f5ef", "kind": "ortofoto", "id": "ortofoto"}, {"background": "#f4f5ef", "html": "<div class=\"element text\" style=\"left:5.45042%;top:3.90597%;width:92.29372%;height:18.22785%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:0.00000cqw 0.00000cqw 0.00000cqw 0.00000cqw;--delay:0.08s\"><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:3.43174cqw;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;color:#2B2B2B\">La tecnología no salva el territorio; la trazabilidad y la gobernanza humana sí</span></p></div><div class=\"element shape\" style=\"left:5.30507%;top:31.24774%;width:89.31416%;height:59.63110%;background:#F7F7F3;--delay:0.47s\"></div><div class=\"element shape\" style=\"left:5.30507%;top:31.24774%;width:89.31416%;height:59.63110%;background:#F7F7F3;border:0.0757cqw solid #A6A6A6;--delay:0.47s\"></div><div class=\"element shape\" style=\"left:19.98486%;top:31.24774%;width:0.00000%;height:59.63110%;border-left:0.0757cqw solid #A6A6A6;--delay:0.54s\"></div><div class=\"element shape\" style=\"left:49.99849%;top:31.24774%;width:0.00000%;height:59.63110%;border-left:0.0757cqw solid #A6A6A6;--delay:0.67s\"></div><div class=\"element shape\" style=\"left:65.84103%;top:31.24774%;width:0.00000%;height:59.63110%;border-left:0.0757cqw solid #A6A6A6;--delay:0.75s\"></div><div class=\"element shape\" style=\"left:5.30507%;top:60.15190%;width:89.31416%;height:0.00000%;border-top:0.0757cqw solid #A6A6A6;--delay:0.71s\"></div><div class=\"element text\" style=\"left:22.16503%;top:33.20072%;width:26.38002%;height:24.99819%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-conten